    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "1CH 17:1",
        "text": "When David was living in his house, David said to Nathan the prophet, “Behold, I live in a cedar house, but the ark of the LORD’s covenant is in a tent.”",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH17.htm#V1",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "0044d05cc2162e37ecec22ba0958f5a3033eafb0c49157b6211239f703a1376b"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 17:2",
        "text": "Nathan said to David, “Do all that is in your heart; for God is with you.”",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH17.htm#V2",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "026f7a0c3096efb758b21f0671885db05bc1b6d5470c2b488b9cbf2afb67e81a"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 17:3",
        "text": "That same night, the word of God came to Nathan, saying,",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH17.htm#V3",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "48dbf77c7c403508dd169a3f89b367de231db5e55acae9c9085310dcfda9b905"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 17:15",
        "text": "According to all these words, and according to all this vision, so Nathan spoke to David.",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH17.htm#V15",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "225a1c3924b233eb6648d2a5a385fa596ad6b34e089e46d28052cf3ee00eb164"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 29:29",
        "text": "Now the acts of David the king, first and last, behold, they are written in the history of Samuel the seer, and in the history of Nathan the prophet, and in the history of Gad the seer,",
